{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-sing#feature-1","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-sing","commit":"55e3ee899b51bd98d12160fa100c4725ad26f0ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-sing 的功能「多源歌曲搜索」：从 QQ 音乐、酷狗或网易云查询曲目，并按关键词、时长及屏蔽词过滤候选结果。可由 QQ 点歌流程或 qq_sing_search 工具触发，返回歌曲名、歌手、时长和会员标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:188","lib/index.js:501"]}
